   "why": "A PEAK TO PEAK THAT Q15 CANNOT HOLD: the extremes of the format are 65535 apart, which saturates at 32767 rather than wrapping to a number that would read as a quiet window. The root mean square of the same window is 4095 and not 4096, because 32768 squared plus 32767 squared over 128 samples is 16776704 and 4096 squared is 16777216, which is larger: the truncation shows at the top of the format as well as at the bottom",
